Testing
step 1 :
pip install pytest pytest-django pytest-html

step 2:
pytest.ini  (create the file at root folder, add the details inside file)
[pytest]
DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE = mysite.settings
python_files = tests.py test_*.py *_tests.py

step 3:
Run tests and generate HTML report, yse this command



pytest detection/tests_unit/test_login.py --html=login_test_report.html --self-contained-html
pytest detection/tests_unit/test_dashboard.py --html=test_dashboard_report.html --self-contained-html
